"high, and let it show the part of the image with its top left corner at ``sx``, ``sy`` and the "
"size ``sw`` by ``sh``, in the user units of the image, which is the whole image unless the "
"placement was made with a source rectangle. The position in the user units of the image is::"
msgstr ""
"设报告位置为 ``x``、``y``，单位是相对字符单元区域左上角的物理像素 1/256。笔划开始的图像放置，其显示矩形左上角距字符区域左上角为 ``L``、``T`` 物理像素，宽 "
"``W``、高 ``H``；所显示的图像区域左上角为 ``sx``、``sy``，尺寸 ``sw`` 乘 "
"``sh``，单位为图像用户单位；未指定源矩形时就是整幅图像。换算到图像用户单位的位置为：::"

#: docs/ink-protocol.rst:204
msgid ""
"Let ``M`` be the product of the transforms of the groups from the root group down to the group of"
" the stroke, each the matrix the ``t`` of its ``g`` record gives and the identity where there is "
"none, the root first. The point is given in the coordinate system of that group::"
msgstr "设 ``M`` 为根分组到笔划分组的变换乘积，按根分组在先的顺序，每个矩阵取自其 ``g`` 记录的 ``t``，缺省为单位矩阵。点在该分组坐标系中的位置为：::"

#: docs/ink-protocol.rst:211
msgid "The width follows the pressure. With ``p`` the pressure of the report::"
msgstr "宽度随压力变化。设报告压力为 ``p``：::"

#: docs/ink-protocol.rst:217
msgid ""
"A tool that does not measure pressure thus draws at the width of full pressure. The report of an "
"``up`` has a pressure of ``0`` when the tool measures pressure, so a stroke ends at the width "
"``w0``."
msgstr "因此，不测量压力的工具按满压力宽度绘制。能测量压力的工具，其 ``up`` 报告压力为 ``0``，所以笔划以宽度 ``w0`` 结束。"

#: docs/ink-protocol.rst:221
msgid ""
"Where a placement is shown is the graphics protocol's business. For a placement at column ``c0`` "
"and row ``r0`` of the screen, counted from zero from the top left of what is shown now, with the "
"offsets ``X``, ``Y`` into that cell and a cell of ``cw`` by ``ch`` pixels, kitty has::"
msgstr ""
"放置的显示位置由图形协议决定。若放置位于当前可见屏幕从零开始的列 ``c0``、行 ``r0``，单元内偏移为 ``X``、``Y``，字符单元尺寸为 ``cw`` 乘 ``ch`` 像素，则 "
"kitty 使用：::"

#: docs/ink-protocol.rst:234
msgid "What happens during a stroke"
msgstr "笔划进行期间的变化"

#: docs/ink-protocol.rst:236
msgid ""
"The stroke stays with the placement it began in. The tablet pointer protocol keeps a stroke "
"captured by its window when the pen leaves it, and the ink follows in the same way: positions "
"outside the placement give points outside the image, by the same formulas, and whatever of the "
"stroke falls outside is not seen."
msgstr "笔划始终附着于起始放置。数位板指针协议在笔离开窗口时仍将笔划捕获到原窗口，墨迹也同样处理：放置区域外的位置按相同公式算成图像外的点，超出区域的部分不可见。"

#: docs/ink-protocol.rst:242
msgid "Each point is worked out with what holds when its report is made:"
msgstr "每个点都依据生成相应报告时的状态计算："

#: docs/ink-protocol.rst:244
msgid ""
"When the placement moves, because the screen scrolls or the user scrolls back, ``L`` and ``T`` "
"are those of where it is shown now, so the ink stays under the pen."
msgstr "屏幕滚动或用户回滚使放置移动时，``L`` 和 ``T`` 使用当前显示位置，使墨迹仍位于笔下。"

#: docs/ink-protocol.rst:247
msgid ""
"When the transform of the group or of a group above it changes, later points are taken through "
"the new transforms; the points already in the element move with the group, as they do for any "
"element."
msgstr "目标分组或其祖先分组的变换改变时，后续点使用新变换；已有点随分组一起移动，与其他元素一样。"

#: docs/ink-protocol.rst:250
msgid ""
"A report whose position cannot be taken into the group, because the group has gone or a transform"
" can no longer be inverted, adds no point. The stroke goes on with the next report."
msgstr "若分组消失或变换不再可逆，导致报告位置无法换算到分组，则不添加该点，下一条报告仍可继续笔划。"

#: docs/ink-protocol.rst:253
msgid ""
"When the image or the placement goes away, deleted, scrolled out of the scrollback or replaced by"
" a new transmission of the image, the stroke of ink is over. Nothing is deleted on its account, "
"and the reports of the stroke go on to the program."
msgstr "图像或放置被删除、滚出回滚缓冲区，或因重新传输图像而替换时，该墨迹笔划结束。不会因此删除已有内容，笔划报告仍继续交给程序。"

#: docs/ink-protocol.rst:257
msgid ""
"When the window switches between the main and the alternate screen, the strokes on the images of "
"the screen that is left are over in the same way."
msgstr "窗口在主屏幕与备用屏幕间切换时，被离开屏幕上的图像笔划同样结束。"

#: docs/ink-protocol.rst:260
msgid ""
"A brush given during a stroke applies from the next stroke; the one being drawn keeps the brush "
"it began with. Turning ink off during a stroke leaves what has been drawn and adds no more to it."
msgstr "笔划期间提供的新画笔从下一笔开始应用，当前笔划继续使用起始画笔。中途关闭墨迹会保留已有绘制，不再添加新点。"

#: docs/ink-protocol.rst:265
msgid "An example"
msgstr "示例"

#: docs/ink-protocol.rst:267
msgid ""
"A program has a vector image ``7`` of 400 by 300 units placed at its own size with its corner 30 "
"pixels across and 40 pixels down the cell area. It finds out that the terminal inks and gives it "
"a brush, a dark blue line between one and five units wide, with fifty ids from 1000::"
msgstr ""
"程序有一幅 ``7`` 号矢量图像，尺寸 400 乘 300 用户单位，以原尺寸放置，左上角位于字符区域向右 30、向下 40 "
"像素处。探测到终端支持墨迹后，提供画笔：深蓝色，宽度一至五个用户单位，从 1000 起保留五十个 ID：::"

#: docs/ink-protocol.rst:277
msgid ""
"The pen touches down 100 pixels across and 200 down at a fifth of full pressure, moves five "
"pixels right and two down while pressing harder, and lifts a pixel further on. The program "
"receives::"
msgstr "笔在向右 100、向下 200 像素处，以满压力的五分之一落下；随后压力增大，向右移动五像素、向下移动两像素，再向前移动一像素后抬起。程序收到：::"

#: docs/ink-protocol.rst:285
msgid "and by the time it does the terminal has applied to image ``7``, and drawn::"
msgstr "程序收到报告时，终端已经对图像 ``7`` 应用并绘制了：::"

#: docs/ink-protocol.rst:291
msgid ""
"since ``70 = (25600 / 256 - 30) * 400 / 400`` and ``1.8 = 1 + (5 - 1) * 13107 / 65535``. The "
"program adds the same three points to its own copy of the scene under the id 1000. If it wants a "
"smoother line it now sends, with the edit action, a ``k`` record with that id and the points it "
"prefers; if it decides the stroke was a tap that selects something instead, it sends ``x "
"id=1000``. Otherwise it sends nothing: the stroke is already there."
msgstr ""
"因为 ``70 = (25600 / 256 - 30) * 400 / 400``，且 ``1.8 = 1 + (5 - 1) * 13107 / 65535``。程序在自己的场景副本中，以 "
"ID 1000 添加相同三点。如果需要更平滑的线条，可通过编辑操作发送相同 ID、使用自选点的 ``k`` 记录；如果判断该笔划实际是选择操作的点击，则发送 ``x "
"id=1000``。否则无需发送内容：笔划已存在。"

#: docs/ink-protocol.rst:299
msgid "Relays and multiplexers"
msgstr "中继与多路复用器"

#: docs/ink-protocol.rst:301
msgid ""
"A relay or a multiplexer that passes the bytes of both directions through needs to know nothing "
"of this protocol, and the ink is drawn by the terminal at the end, which is where the pen is: "
"this is the case the protocol exists for."
msgstr "双向透传字节的中继或多路复用器不必了解本协议，墨迹由链路末端、即笔所在位置的终端绘制；这正是本协议的主要用途。"

#: docs/ink-protocol.rst:306
msgid ""
"One that keeps the scene of a vector image as a table of records, so as to send it to a terminal "
"that connects later, has to keep that table true. It either answers the query itself with "
"``caps=0`` and passes no brush on, or it adds to its table the records this page says the "
"terminal applies, working them out from the reports it forwards, the brush it passed on and the "
"placement as its client shows it. One that translates the positions of reports for a pane does so"
" before it works them out, and one that moves or resizes a pane cancels the strokes in it, as the"
" tablet pointer protocol requires, which removes their ink."
msgstr ""
"将矢量场景保存为记录表、以便稍后发送给新连接终端的中继，必须维持记录表与实际场景一致。它可以自行用 ``caps=0`` "
"回答查询、不转发画笔；也可根据转发的报告、画笔及客户端显示的放置，计算并加入终端按本页规则应用的记录。若为窗格转换报告位置，应先转换再计算；移动或调整窗格大小时，按数位板指针协议取消其中笔划，从而移除对应墨迹。"

#: docs/ink-protocol.rst:316
msgid ""
"A multiplexer keeps the mode and the brush of each pane with the rest of its state and turns ink "
"off when detaching."
msgstr "多路复用器与其他状态一起保存每个窗格的模式与画笔，脱离连接时关闭墨迹。"

#: docs/ink-protocol.rst:320
msgid "Implementations"
msgstr "实现情况"

#: docs/ink-protocol.rst:322
msgid "silkie, this fork of kitty, wherever it reports tools."
msgstr "silkie，即此 kitty 分支，在能报告工具的所有平台上实现。"

#: docs/ink-protocol.rst:325
msgid "Implementation notes for silkie"
msgstr "silkie 实现说明"

#: docs/ink-protocol.rst:327
msgid ""
"A report is turned into its record and applied before the report is written to the program, and "
"the image is drawn again with the next frame through the partial redraw of :doc:`vector images "
"<vector-protocol>`, which draws only the rectangle around the new piece of the stroke. Silkie "
"grows its active stroke storage as tools begin drawing; there is no fixed limit on simultaneous "
"tools. The points of a stroke count toward the image storage quota like those a program sends."
msgstr ""
"终端在向程序写入报告前，将报告转换为记录并应用；图像在下一帧通过 :doc:`矢量图像 <vector-protocol>` 的局部重绘显示，只重绘新增笔划周围的矩形。Silkie "
"随工具开始绘制而动态扩展活动笔划存储，同时工具数量没有固定上限。笔划中的点与程序发送的点一样，计入图像存储配额。"

